ZH: "<'EVA' speaking>\n'Wait, General, there is a large force up ahead. I'll call for an EMP strike to clear the areastandby'"
BP: "<'EVA' speaking>\n'Wait, General, there is a large force up ahead. I'll call for an EMP strike to clear the areastandby'"
PL: "<'EVA' speaking>\n'Wait, General, there is a large force up ahead. I'll call for an EMP strike to clear the areastandby'"
END

SCRIPT:CHI02AudioHolder19
